          "$type": "text",
          "text": "<S0>Let's think step by step:</S0>\n\n1. The context provided is about the CP-200 Centrifugal Pump Operating and Maintenance Manual, specifically section 4.3 Seal-water connection.\n2. The query is about what has to be fitted in the seal-water line of a CP-200.\n3. The response provided by the assistant is \"An isolation valve, a strainer and a pressure gauge must be fitted in the seal-water line of a CP-200. The seal-water pressure must exceed the suction pressure by at least 1 bar whenever the pump runs.\"\n4. This response directly addresses the query and provides relevant information from the context, including the specific requirements for the seal-water line.\n\n<S1>Explanation</S1>\n\nThe response provides a complete and accurate answer to the query, including the necessary components to be fitted in the seal-water line and the required pressure condition. It demonstrates a thorough understanding of the context and provides relevant information to address the question.\n\n<S2>Score: 5</S2>"
